    "custom_liquid_DQewwy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "custom_css": [
        "a {color: rgba(129, 188, 182, 0.85); text-decoration-color: rgba(129, 188, 182, 0.85);}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n\n<h2>Office Fit-Outs Designed for Your Business Success</h2>\n\n<p>Transform your workplace with confidence. With nearly 30 years of experience, Smart Office Furniture provides complete office fit-out solutions across New Zealand , from initial concept to final installation.</p>\n\n<p>With nearly three decades of experience, Smart Office Furniture offers a complete office fit-out solution , from layout planning and custom furniture sourcing to nationwide delivery and on-site installation. Our goal is to simplify your office transformation by offering expert advice and responsive service, backed by a trusted team with extensive local knowledge. <a id=\"show-more\" href=\"#read-more\">Read More</a></p>\n\n<div id=\"read-more\">\n<p>Whether you're refreshing a single room or fitting out an entire office, we offer ergonomic furniture, tailored advice, and seamless coordination to create productive, stylish, and future-ready workspaces.</p>\n\n<h2>What&rsquo;s Included in Our Fit-Out Service</h2>\n\n<p>We take the guesswork out of office design by managing the entire process for you. Our end-to-end service includes:</p>\n\n<ul>\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Workplace Needs Assessment</span><br /> We&rsquo;ll meet with you to understand your team&rsquo;s needs, workflow, and goals for the space.<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Layout Planning &amp; Space Optimisation</span><br /> Our experts create a tailored layout to maximise comfort, efficiency, and compliance.<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Furniture Selection &amp; Sourcing</span><br /> Choose from a wide range of desks, chairs, tables, and storage solutions &ndash; delivered directly from our NZ-based warehouses.<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Delivery &amp; Installation</span><br /> Our logistics team coordinates fast, reliable delivery and professional on-site installation, nationwide.<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Ongoing Support</span><br /> We&rsquo;re here after the install with expert guidance and ongoing product support.<br /></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>A Proven Process That Delivers</h2>\n\n<p>Here&rsquo;s how we make your office fit-out simple and stress-free:</p>\n\n<ol>\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Initial Consultation</span> &ndash; We assess your space and project goals<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Design &amp; Quote</span> &ndash; You&rsquo;ll receive layout plans and a detailed proposal<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Product Selection</span> &ndash; Choose your ideal furniture and finishes<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Delivery &amp; Installation</span> &ndash; We handle logistics, setup, and clean-up<br /></li>\n\n    <li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Post-Project Support</span> &ndash; We're available for upgrades or adjustments as your needs evolve<br /></li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2>Fit-Out Projects Completed Across New Zealand</h2>\n\n<p>Since 1996, we&rsquo;ve supported businesses, schools, government offices, and growing startups with tailored fit-out solutions. With warehousing and logistics support across the country, we can deliver your office setup in as little as 10 business days.</p>\n\n<h2>Why Choose Smart Office Furniture?</h2>\n\n<ul>\n    <li>30 Years of Industry Experience<br /></li>\n\n    <li>Nationwide Delivery &amp; Installation<br /></li>\n\n    <li>NZ-Owned, Local Support Team<br /></li>\n\n    <li>Thousands of Fit-Outs Completed<br /></li>\n\n    <li>Affordable, Ergonomic &amp; Stylish Options<br /></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Ready to Plan Your Office Fit-Out?</h2>\n\n<p>We offer free on-site consultations to help you plan the perfect space, no obligation.</p>\n\n<p>Call us today or Book your free consultation online to get started.</p>\n\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">How long does a typical office fit-out take?</span><br /> Depending on the scale, most projects are completed in 2&ndash;6 weeks after sign-off. We&rsquo;ll give you a clear timeline during quoting.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Do you only supply furniture, or can you help with layout too?</span><br /> We offer full-service fit-outs, including layout planning, product selection, and installation.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Can you help us stay within budget?</span><br /> Absolutely. We work with all types of businesses, from startups to large corporates , and provide options to suit every budget.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Do you offer matching storage or shelving?</span></p>\n\n<p>Yes, we have matching filing cabinets, bookshelves, and mobile drawer units to complete your setup.</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Are meeting and boardroom tables included in this category?</span></p>\n\n<p>Yes, this collection includes executive desks, bench desks, and office tables like boardroom and conference tables. <a href=\"#read-more\" id=\"hide-less\">Read Less</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 36
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_zwzmBb": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
