    "custom_liquid_hQ9tnf": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "custom_css": [
        "a {color: rgba(129, 188, 182, 0.85); text-decoration-color: rgba(129, 188, 182, 0.85);}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"page-width\">\n<div id=\"read-more\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Choose an Exceptional Office Fit Out with Quality and Style to Match</h2>\n<p>At Smart Office Furniture NZ, we believe that office fit outs should be both functional and stylish. That's why we take the time to understand your specific needs and preferences, ensuring that every aspect of your <strong>office fit out</strong> is tailored to enhance productivity and comfort. Whether you're looking for ergonomic workstations, modern meeting rooms, or vibrant breakout areas, we have the expertise and resources to bring your vision to life.</p>\n<p>In addition to our personalised service, we also offer competitive pricing on all our <strong>office fit out services</strong>. We understand that budget constraints are a reality for many businesses, which is why we work hard to provide cost-effective solutions without compromising on quality. With Smart Office Furniture NZ, you can rest assured that you're getting the best value for your investment. <a href=\"#read-more\" id=\"hide-less\">Read Less</a>\n</div></p>",
        "color_scheme": "background-1",
        "padding_top": 24,
        "padding_bottom": 24
      }
    },
